Package: punKEGGer
Title: Parse, Expand, Annotate and Visualize KEGG Pathway Networks as Tidy Graphs
Version: 0.99.65
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Guillermo",
           family = "de Anda Jáuregui",
           email = "gdeanda@inmegen.edu.mx",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to parse KEGG pathway KGML files into tidy
    graphs, expand metanodes (e.g., multi-gene entries), annotate them with
    custom dictionaries, and produce consistent visualizations using ggraph.
    Enables integration of KEGG pathways with tidygraph-based workflows.
